## Results Directory Management ##############################################
#
# This is the definitive, simplified logic:
# 1. Ignore the entire contents of the results directory by default.
#    This will ignore all heavy data files like .vtu, .pvtu, .problem, etc.
results/*

# 2. BUT, do NOT ignore the results directory itself, so we can look inside it.
!results/

# 3. And do NOT ignore any file ending in .png anywhere inside the results directory.
#    The '**/' matches all subdirectories recursively.
!results/**/*.png